Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:09.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Tokyo Tower! Tokyo Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:11.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:14.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We've still got a ways to go\Nbefore Tokyo Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:15.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is Ueno.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:19.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I think it's where there's a zoo nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:22.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A "zoo"? What's that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:28.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Simply put, it's a place where people can\Ngo see different kinds of animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:31.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,To see? Not to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:34.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nah, it must be different\Nfrom a livestock farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:37.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I want to go to the zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:38.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Not sure about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:51.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The road's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,blocked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:07.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Get out of the car. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:44.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is our turf from here on out.\NOnly answer the questions you're asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:46.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A living person!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:48.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm backing up! Stay in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:52.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm Aki! What's your name?\NLet's be friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.21,0:02:53.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I said, stay in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:58.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They blocked off the back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:02.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You think you're here for\Na picnic or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:07.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll say it again.\NAnswer only the questions I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:09.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:15.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be so uptight.\NIt's bad for your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:18.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You'll never be cute if you keep that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:19.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Shut your ugly mouth.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.99,0:03:23.91,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}SNAP
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:25.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make her cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:36.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wait! We're not looking for a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:37.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Yes, we are!\N- No, we're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:38.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stupid Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:44.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're heading souf.\NWe didn't know dis was your turf!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.47,0:03:43.77,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stupid Yu! Stupid Yu! Stupid Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:48.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We can take anudder road!\NI wepeat, we don't want to fwight!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.60,0:03:48.65,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:50.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Are you the leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:54.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- That's right.\N- Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:56.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm the leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Who cares who's in charge right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:02.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I care.\NRight here, I'm the leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:04.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You being the leader\Nwould only make things worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. We never actually\Nchose a leader, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- I wouldn't feel safe with a weak leader.\N- Wha...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.75,0:04:13.00,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She's right! That makes\Nme a better leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They're just bunch of idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:16.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:24.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I see. Understood. I'll head over, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:30.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo, I'll leave the rest to you.\NThey're just bunch of idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:31.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:40.45,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the misunderstanding.\NPlease, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:41.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A child?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:46.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where'd that uptight woman go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:50.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,If you mean Captain Takamo, there was\Na report of a zombie horde, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:52.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Zombies?! Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:55.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I believe they're near\Nthat intersection over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Dad might be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:05:00.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys! Follow the leader! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I told you, you're not the leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:04.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:05.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wait up! Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:07.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:22.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:41.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's rare to see a horde this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:57.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Lemme see the zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wrong zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:09.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,"Wrong zombie"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:12.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.33,0:06:16.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,If my dad's turned into a zombie,\NI'm the one who's taking him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:16.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:18.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We told you to wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:30.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.\NBut I, the leader, saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:35.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I didn't need your help.\NI could've taken them down myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:40.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Really? You sure about that?\NLooked pretty close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:42.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,More importantly, Saigo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you\Nnot to leave the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:47.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:50.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Call me Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:53.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, Captain Takamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:07.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're Miss Prickly's little brother?\NYou don't look alike at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:08.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Miss Prickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:10.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,She's always so prickly,\Nso that's what I'm gonna call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:15.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I see. Um, I'm sorry about\NCaptain Takamo's attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:17.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:20.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're close to Sakura's age,\Nbut you've really got your act together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:22.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:23.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:26.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Then I'm older than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:31.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself.\NMy name's Saigo. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:34.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Same here.\N- Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:38.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let me know if you need more trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:39.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:55.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I think I smell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:58.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Really? I don't sense anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:02.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Would you all like to come inside and\Nhave a look around our base?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:04.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're only allowed to stay until\Nearly evening, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:06.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Your base? I wanna see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:08.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Might as well make a little detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:10.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We've never seen\Nanother group's base before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:14.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,All right! Follow your leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nobody said you're the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:21.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:24.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Look at all these people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:28.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Welcome to our Ueno Base.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.30,0:08:31.26,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}LIVESTOCK GRAZING ZONE 3
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So big! So pretty! So base!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:34.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow, you'd never guess it was\Nthis big from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:38.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Is the entire park your base?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:43.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes. There are all kinds of cultural\Nattractions here, including a zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's right! The zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:51.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I want to see the animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't think there'd be any left...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:55.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's a bicycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:58.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I know because I'm a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:08:59.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wanna give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:00.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:04.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I wanna try, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.55,0:09:08.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:10.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Which way is the zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:17.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's harder than it looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:22.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ZOO
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:26.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pandas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There's a panda here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could take a panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:32.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You can't hunt pandas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:37.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Panda! Panda! Panda, panda! Panda! Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:42.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:46.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What are zombies doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:51.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us behind, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:54.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Aki! How are you already so good\Nat riding the bicycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:56.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Put me down, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:58.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But you're slow.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.56,0:10:01.52,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}GORILLA FOREST
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:01.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please make your way\Nover to the enclosure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:10.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I see. You guys are using the\Nzoo enclosures to study kairis... zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:11.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:12.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pandas...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I wonder if my dad's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:17.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:20.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There's a zombie that looks\Njust like a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:25.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,She must've turned recently. Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:27.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:29.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're a human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:35.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're in there with zombies!\NWhy aren't they attacking you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:36.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.93,0:10:40.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Hmph.\N- Don't just look away! Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:46.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,She's not good with people,\Nso she prefers being in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:48.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Cut her some slack.\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:51.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So she'd rather hang out\Nwith zombies than people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:54.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.\NWhy aren't they attacking her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:59.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Because the zombies here don't\Nlike being around people, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:02.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They don't like people?!\NBut they're zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:07.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Just like humans, zombies apparently\Nhave personalities of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:11.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But we don't know if their personalities\Nreflect who they were before they turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:17.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,In any case, some zombies simply\Ndon't attack humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:20.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We call those zombies the\N"socially awkward" type.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:23.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A socially awkward kairi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:25.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Takamo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:30.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo won't abandon me\Nor even those type of zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:36.45,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,If you come across any zombies like these,\Nplease bring them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:39.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:56.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Right in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:06.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}<- MEAL DISTRIBUTION\NTODAY'S MENU: HAMBURGER
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:11.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:14.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's so easy to eat, too. I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:18.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Lettuce, cucumber, tomatoes...\NIt's packed with veggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:19.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How do you get so many vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:25.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We have vegetable gardens all around\Nthe base, so we use what we grow here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:28.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We grow flowers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:31.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Really? I'd love to see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:34.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Do you raise your own meat, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We do. We've got our own ranch here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:39.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A ranch, huh? Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:43.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I've always preferred raising\Nanimals to hunting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:46.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This place has it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:48.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:53.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Now that we're full,\Nlet's help out around the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:54.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:56.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Me, too! I want to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:58.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:00.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- We'll take three.\N- How long are you planning to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:01.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:04.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Miss Prickl—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're not planning to stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:09.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're headed for Tokyo Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Tokyo Tower, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:13.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:15.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Three hamburgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:16.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:20.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever. Just stay out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:29.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Still as uptight as ever.\NHas she always been that prickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:34.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Back then, I guess\Nshe wasn't really Miss Prickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:37.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But now that she's the captain,\Nshe's got a lot on her shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.61,0:13:39.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ah, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:43.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're all welcome to keep looking around\Nfor the rest of the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:09.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:12.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm done tending the garden,\Nso I'll help you out here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:15.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:21.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's a really nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:22.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:26.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's spacious and full of life.\NEveryone seems so happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:30.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's amazing that your big sister\Nmanaged to build a base like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:37.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose you're right. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:44.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I just want my sister to laugh and\Nsmile the way she used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:49.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We came here about two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.97,0:14:51.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That long?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:57.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes. My sister took the lead as we cleared\Nout the zombies, welcomed new people,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:14:59.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,and slowly grew the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:03.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We even built this flower bed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:10.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But as the base grew to its current size\Nand we took in more people,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:15.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,my sister became captain,\Nand her workload kept growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:18.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And little by little, she stopped\Nsmiling the way she used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:24.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to fill this\Nflower bed with all kinds of flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:27.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,and maybe it'll bring\Nher a little comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:35.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But only certain adults can go outside,\Nso it's hard to find different flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:37.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Then why not just step outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:38.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:41.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You should sneak out and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:45.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:50.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Um, it's almost time.\N- Time for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:56.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The base gates will be closing soon,\Nso I need to see you all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:00.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Man, what a haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:03.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're having fish for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:05.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's share some with the people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:07.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't know if Miss Prickly\Nwould be happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:11.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,She'd probably say,\N"Keep it. Your assistance is unnecessary."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:14.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's so accurate, Nacchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:25.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Aki! Natsuki! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.11,0:16:27.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,He sure is full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:28.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Where'd Sakura go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:32.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,She said she was going to help Saigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:36.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry and\Nfind somewhere to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:39.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So we're sleeping outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:40.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:44.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:47.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I knew it. I definitely smell them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:56.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:57.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I had fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:00.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A zombie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:01.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:10.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:13.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:16.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Too bad. It wasn't my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:18.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There was another zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:22.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's so weird about that?\NThey're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:26.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We've already taken out most\Nof the zombies around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.05,0:17:28.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Just like how they appeared earlier today—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:30.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,it's strange for so many\Nto show up one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.47,0:17:33.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The only possibility I can think of\Nis the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:40.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was connected to the underground\Ntunnels, but we cleared the zombies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:42.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,and locked it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:45.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So it's impossible for zombies to be\Ncoming out of the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:50.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Really? But it came from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:51.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:54.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:18:00.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There's no way zombies\Ncould've gotten in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo, we should\Ninvestigate the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:12.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:21.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:23.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is pretty cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:24.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:28.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is the former Park Station.\NThere are tracks running underground,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:32.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,along with the remains of a station that\Nwas shut down long before the Red Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:35.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There are train tracks down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.71,0:18:47.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I smell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:49.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:52.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Aki can smell zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:53.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:55.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ugh, do we have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:57.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:58.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:01.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo, you stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:04.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,If anything happens,\Nalert the troops back at the base!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:07.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Sneak...\N- You too, Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:10.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come on! I can fight, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Stupid Yu! Stupid Yu! Stupid, stupid Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:21.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,From what you said earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.54,0:19:25.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,could kairis have gotten into\Nthe underground tunnels?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:29.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We've barricaded the\Ntunnel entrances outside our base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.13,0:19:31.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There's no way they can come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:33.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Keep it down. Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:54.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Didn't I just say to be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.57,0:19:56.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:58.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Let me borrow that.\N- Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:03.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.65,0:20:36.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Zombies everywhere!\N- There are too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.19,0:20:37.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:39.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.45,0:20:41.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is bad! Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:44.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But we were just\Ngetting to the good part!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:05.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo! Order a base-wide evacuation!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:06.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:17.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What are those? Fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.53,0:21:22.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They just keep coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:25.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The fence isn't gonna hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:34.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The zoo gate is our last line of defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:36.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You all need to evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:37.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:39.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But what about my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:41.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:43.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's retreat for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:47.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please hurry!

